<metadata><name>Day 53 - Kimberley Forest, Valley Crossover, Wodehouse Karst</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.378272" lon="-80.569282"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on 7th Line at the beginning of the Wodehouse Karst Side Trail</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.378363" lon="-80.556104"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.373776" lon="-80.554959"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Kimberley Forest Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.357694" lon="-80.544967"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Valley Crossover Side Trail, heading east. (the blue-blazed Valley Crossover Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
